  "title": "Janani Suraksha Yojnna:",
  "summary": "Schemes — Janani Suraksha Yojnna:",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        " Launched on 12th April 2005, JSY aims to promote institutional deliveries and reduce maternal",
        "and infant mortality.",
        " Key Features:",
        " Cash Assistance: Rs. 1400 (rural) / Rs. 1000 (urban) for women, Rs. 600 (rural) / Rs. 400",
        "(urban) for ASHA workers.",
        " Eligibility:",
        " High-performing states: BPL women (19+ years).",
        " Low-performing states: All pregnant women (focus on Rajasthan, Chhattisgarh, Bihar, Orissa,",
        "UP, J&K).",
        " The scheme ensures safe deliveries at health institutions with financial support for improved",
        "maternal health outcomes."
      ]
    }
  ],
